					Hdt.
					6.106
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				5.2.2
			</span></i>, etc.; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ δ.</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμέρᾳ</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.113
			</span></i>.</div>
